message: "If you use or adapt this study, cite the repository and the original concept reference."
title: "Aurelis Calibre 07 — Anatomy of a Second"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The Aurelis Study"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
url: "https://somphol.github.io/aurelis-calibre-07/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/somphol/aurelis-calibre-07"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A single-page WebGL study of a fictional mechanical wristwatch that disassembles as the
  visitor scrolls. The site, watch geometry, dial artwork and environment are procedural and
  offline-first. It was built in one OpenCode session with DeepSeek V4.1 Flash from a
  one-sentence brief.
keywords:
  - Three.js
  - WebGL
  - procedural
  - horology
  - scroll
  - interaction design
references:
